        h2 Information

        p A set of Gulp plugins for transforming and formatting Design Tokens. This plugin is responsible for transforming raw values into platform specific values. We use it for transforming YAML values into SCSS and JSON.
        p Its not possible to use SCSS variables in our Javascript functionality. Theo helps by transforming YAML value into JSON values to be able to use them in our Javascript functionality.